\noindent\textbf{Problem Statement:}
The first step towards solving the problem is to collect real-world clinical notes, and to annotate them with the simplified versions of the medical text.
However, as mentioned before, the task of simplifying medical text is new and very few corpora have been published for this task. This calls for an automatic approach to generate the simplified versions of the notes, so that more annotated data can be collected.
