\noindent\textbf{Medical Text Summarization:}

The sample solution uses the following technique:

  • The sentence is stored in an array, with one character in each array element.

  • The index of the character is multiplied by 2, and the result is stored in a new array.

  • The original sentence is replaced by this new array, then the array elements are reversed.

  • The character array is used to form a new string, with the characters separated by spaces.

